@kai-swimlane 2
@lang ja, en;
@use ./templates/role/standard.swim;

/title/
出荷準備 | Shipping preparation;

/line/
[warehouse: ピッキングリスト出力 | Print the picking list]

[warehouse: ピッキング | Pick]

if [warehouse] (破損あり？ | Any damage?)
case (あり | Yes) #red
  [warehouse: 代替品を引当 | Allocate a replacement]
  loop
case (なし | No) #green
  [warehouse: 梱包 | Pack]
end-if

[warehouse: 出荷ラベル貼付 | Attach the shipping label]

@end
